{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-04-24 16:09:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL INCREASES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) INCREASED THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND BY 8 PERCENT, OR $0.10 PER COMMON SHARE, TO $1.35 PER COMMON SHARE PAYABLE ON MAY 19, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 8, 2023. AT AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, WE HAVE BEEN HELPING PEOPLE FEEL CONFIDENT ABOUT THEIR FINANCIAL FUTURE FOR MORE THAN 125 YEARS. WITH EXTENSIVE INVESTMENT ADVICE, ASSET MANAGEMENT AND INSURANCE CAPABILITIE."}{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-04-24 16:08:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 RESULTS, RAISES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND 8 PERCENT', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP): EARNINGS PER DILUTED SHARE \xa0 RETURN ON EQUITY, EX AOCI (1) \xa0 Q1 2023 \xa0 \xa0 Q1 2023 GAAP $3.79 \xa0 GAAP 45.2% ADJUSTED OPERATING $7.25 \xa0 ADJUSTED OPERATING 49.5% \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 FIRST QUARTER ADJUSTED OPERATING EARNINGS PER DILUTED SHARE WAS $7.25, UP 25 PERCENT FROM THE PRIOR YEAR DRIVEN BY STRONG BUSINESS PERFORMANCE IN WEALTH MANAGEMENT. \xa0 PERSPECTIVE FROM JIM CRACCHIOLO, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER \xa0 \xa0 "AMERIPRISE DELIVERED.'}